---
import { EVENT_CONFIG } from "../config/event";
const { story } = EVENT_CONFIG;
---

<section class="px-6 py-6 text-center">
  <p
    data-animate
    class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto text-ink"
  >
    Una historia de amor
    <br />
    que comenzó en <span class="text-accent italic">México.</span>
    <br />
    Hoy, regresamos <span class="text-accent italic">para <br />celebrarla</span
    >
  </p>
</section>
